          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content8\" group=\"Content\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"11\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Stylized\" name=\"stylizedCounters\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Mark\" name=\"mark\" condition=\"stylizedCounters\" checked>\n        <select title=\"Type\" name=\"countersType\" condition=\"stylizedCounters\">\n            <option value=\"default\" selected>circle Fill</option>\n            <option value=\"circle\">Circle</option>\n            <option value=\"square\">Square</option>\n        </select>\n        <input type=\"color\" name=\"iconColor\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#fcdbdb\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"counter-container col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><br><b>FitSpresso</b> is marketed as a dietary supplement for weight management and metabolic wellness. Before deciding whether it fits your routine, it is helpful to consider its potential advantages and limitations.</h4>\n                <div class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"new-font-1\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                    <div><b>Cons of FitSpresso</b></div><div><b><br></b></div><ul><li><span style=\"font-size: 22.4px;\"><b>Results May Vary:</b> Individual outcomes can differ, and weight loss is not guaranteed.</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 22.4px;\"><b>Limited Product-Specific Evidence: </b>Independent clinical evidence establishing FitSpresso's effectiveness may be limited.</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 22.4px;\"><b>Ingredient Verification Needed: </b>The complete ingredient list and dosages should be checked before purchasing.</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 22.4px;\"><b>Possible Side Effects: </b>Depending on its formulation, a supplement may cause unwanted effects or interact with medications.</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 22.4px;\"><b>Not a Replacement for Healthy Habits: </b>Sustainable weight management generally requires balanced nutrition, physical activity, and other healthy lifestyle practices.</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 22.4px;\"><b>Ongoing Cost:</b> Regular purchases may represent an additional expense.</span></li></ul><ul>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
